      "body": "### What type of PR is this?\nBug fix\n\n### Description\nIn `AnthropicServingMessages._detect_merge_inline_system`, the chat template is probed by rendering a sample conversation to determine whether inline system messages require merging. Models whose chat templates check `tools is not none` (such as `allenai/Olmo-3-7B-Instruct`) attempt `tools | tojson` when `tools` is not passed to `render()`, triggering a `TypeError: Object of type Undefined is not JSON serializable`.\n\nPassing `tools=None` when rendering the probe conversation satisfies templates that check `tools is not none`, allowing them to cleanly bypass the tool block and evaluate whether system message merging is necessary without error, while keeping exception handling narrowly scoped to `jinja2.TemplateError`.\n\nCloses #61919\n\n### Checklist\n- [x] Code follows the style guidelines of this project\n- [x] Tests added and passed locally\n- [x] Relevant issue linked\n",
