    {
      "body": "Makes complete sense @robertgshaw2-redhat! Reverted back to narrow `except jinja2.TemplateError:`. Passing `tools=None` resolves the `Undefined` lookup at the source so templates with `tools is not none` checks bypass the block cleanly without raising.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-15T22:41:19Z",
      "diff_hunk": "@@ -292,10 +292,11 @@ def _detect_merge_inline_system(chat_template: str | None) -> bool:\n                     {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"t\"},\n                     {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"t\"},\n                 ],\n+                tools=None,\n                 add_generation_prompt=False,\n             )\n             return False\n-        except jinja2.TemplateError:\n+        except Exception:",
